OL,3,GNEWSACampervan parking ban extended
OL,4,Aafter complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn overnight ban on campervan parking
OL,7,Fin parts of North Yorkshire has been
OL,8,Fextended after councillors said
OL,9,Frestrictions introduced elsewhere had
OL,10,Fled to a "displacement" of problems.
OL,12,FThe original ban, introduced in 2024,
OL,13,Fprohibited overnight parking by motor
OL,14,Fcaravans between 23:00 and 07:00 in
OL,15,FSandsend, along Royal Albert Drive in
OL,16,FScarborough and at Cayton Bay.
OL,18,FThe latest restrictions will apply to
OL,19,FBelvedere Road, Holbeck Road, Esplanade
OL,20,FCrescent and Sea Cliff Road in
OL,21,FScarborough.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
