OL,3,GNEWSACampervan parking ban extended
OL,4,Aafter complaints
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Rich Maw said residents in
OL,7,Faffected streets had reported "waking
OL,8,Fup to campervans outside their windows,
OL,9,Fdisposing of grey water, and hanging up
OL,10,Flaundry on their hedges".
